  "sections": [
    {
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "heading": "Ritual Caster 5e: DnD 5e Feat Guide",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-intro-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Wizard is famously among the best ritual casters in the game due to their ability to cast any ritual spell from their spellbook. But the Ritual Caster feat makes the Wizard’s superiority with rituals available to nearly anyone and using several possible spell lists. But which do we pick? Why? And is this feat actually worth the cost?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
